                <invention-title lang="de">VORRICHTUNG UND VERFAHREN FÜR REMOTE-DIREKTSPEICHERZUGRIFF</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIF ET PROCÉDÉ D'ACCÈS DIRECT À UNE MÉMOIRE DISTANTE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">A DEVICE AND METHOD FOR REMOTE DIRECT MEMORY ACCESS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure relates to a device and method for RDMA. Specifically, the disclosure proposes a network device, which is configured to transmit an outgoing packet to another network device. In particular, the outgoing packet is a QUIC based packet, which comprises a UDP header, a QUIC header and a QUIC payload. In particular, the UDP header of the outgoing packet comprises an indication that indicates that the QUIC payload of the outgoing packet comprises one or more RDMA transactions. Further, the QUIC payload of the outgoing packet comprises the one or more RDMA transactions. In this way, a solution to run RDMA over the QUIC transport protocol without affecting other applications is provided.</p>
            </abstract>
